- `useRemoveMember()` mutation - calls `authClient.organization.removeMember({ memberIdOrEmail })`
- `useUpdateMemberRole()` mutation - calls `authClient.organization.updateMemberRole({ memberId, role })`
- Both should show success/error toasts using `sonner`
- Both should refetch members list on success

