- `useInvitations()` query - calls `authClient.organization.listInvitations()`
- `useInviteMember()` mutation - calls `authClient.organization.inviteMember({ email, role })`
- `useCancelInvitation()` mutation - calls `authClient.organization.cancelInvitation({ invitationId })`
- All with toast notifications and query invalidation

5. `apps/web/src/components/organization/hooks/index.ts`:
Export all hooks.

