### 5. Session Management

#### Get Session
```typescript
// Client - hook (reactive)
const { data: session, isPending, error, refetch } = authClient.useSession()

// Client - one-time fetch
const { data: session } = await authClient.getSession()

// Server
const session = await auth.api.getSession({
    headers: await headers()
})
```

#### List Sessions
```typescript
const sessions = await authClient.listSessions()
```

#### Revoke Sessions
```typescript
// Revoke specific session
await authClient.revokeSession({
    token: "session-token"
})

// Revoke all other sessions (keep current)
await authClient.revokeOtherSessions()

// Revoke all sessions
await authClient.revokeSessions()
```

**Server configuration for session management:**
```typescript
export const auth = betterAuth({
    session: {
        expiresIn: 60 * 60 * 24 * 7, // 7 days
        updateAge: 60 * 60 * 24, // 1 day
        freshAge: 60 * 60 * 24, // 1 day - for "fresh session" checks
        disableSessionRefresh: false,
        cookieCache: {
            enabled: true,
            maxAge: 5 * 60, // 5 minutes
            strategy: "compact" // or "jwt" or "jwe"
        }
    }
})
```

---

### 6. Account Linking (OAuth Providers)

#### List Linked Accounts
```typescript
const accounts = await authClient.listAccounts()
```

#### Link Social Account
```typescript
// Standard OAuth flow
await authClient.linkSocial({
    provider: "google",
    callbackURL: "/callback"
})

// With custom scopes
await authClient.linkSocial({
    provider: "google",
    callbackURL: "/callback",
    scopes: ["https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.readonly"]
})

// With ID token (no redirect)
await authClient.linkSocial({
    provider: "google",
    idToken: {
        token: "id_token_from_provider",
        nonce: "nonce",
        accessToken: "access_token", // Optional
        refreshToken: "refresh_token" // Optional
    }
})
```

#### Unlink Account
```typescript
await authClient.unlinkAccount({
    providerId: "google"
})

// Unlink specific account (if multiple of same provider)
await authClient.unlinkAccount({
    providerId: "google",
    accountId: "123"
})
```

**Server configuration:**
```typescript
export const auth = betterAuth({
    account: {
        accountLinking: {
            enabled: true, // default
            trustedProviders: ["google", "github"], // Force-link trusted providers
            allowDifferentEmails: false,
            updateUserInfoOnLink: false,
            allowUnlinkingAll: false // Prevent account lockout
        }
    }
})
```

